hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1143","Muhammad bin Yahya told us, Saad bin Abdul Hamid told us, Abd al-Rahman bin Abi al-Zannad told us, on the authority of Musa bin Uqba, on the authority of Ibn Salman, on the authority of his father, Abu Abdullah Salman Al-Aghar, who said: Abu Hurairah said, The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever prays on the night With one hundred verses, he will not be recorded as one of the heedless, and whoever prays two hundred verses in a night, he will be recorded as one of the obedient and sincere.”"
